    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `synthesize_text.py` that synthesizes plain text to an audio byte stream using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Polly service, which is a text-to-speech service that uses advanced deep learning technologies to synthesize speech that sounds like a human voice. I will import the necessary AWS SDK for Python (Boto3) and use the Polly client to synthesize the text. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
